itical-shakeup-video'&gt;习近平调查上海领导人，扩大政治变动&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Xi Probes Shanghai Boss, Widening Political Shakeup&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/xi-probes-shanghai-boss-widening-political-shakeup-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 04:25:11 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 随着芯片限制影响数据中心项目，马来亚银行审查投资组合</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/maybank-reviews-portfolio-as-chip-curbs-hit-data-center-projects</link><description>马来西亚最大的银行正在审查其投资组合，以了解美国最新芯片限制措施的潜在风险，同时评估这些限制可能如何影响数据中心客户及其融资需求。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/maybank-reviews-portfolio-as-chip-curbs-hit-data-center-projects'&gt;随着芯片限制影响数据中心项目，马来亚银行审查投资组合&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Maybank Reviews Portfolio as Chip Curbs Hit Data Center Projects&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/maybank-reviews-portfolio-as-chip-curbs-hit-data-center-projects</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 04:35:30 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[BBC等2家] 基尔马·阿布雷戈·加西亚离开美国前往西班牙，结束特朗普驱逐战</title><link>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c6808pyy5dl9o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss</link><description>他被驱逐到萨尔瓦多并返回美国成为唐纳德·特朗普总统移民议程辩论的焦点。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 2 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[BBC]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c6808pyy5dl9o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss'&gt;基尔马·阿布雷戈·加西亚离开美国前往西班牙，结束特朗普驱逐战&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Kilmar Ábrego García leaving US for Spain, ending Trump deportation battle&lt;/small&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[CNN]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxNcG1HVEl5OFFJbUMtcllrTmlxUlRUdXFjTkNiOXBJVmc5TVJ0eDdiUFVJX3dMeGpOR0N2UGRKVGgtMXdqY2piOFE5WGpaTkR3YTJva3EyMWtxdzJ4QmZBRm05TGF0NVRoOWpJVHdwMlpta3FVZWU2aWU3MXZQck